WEBVTT

56:32.255 --> 56:34.423
But what if we
leave them behind?

56:34.507 --> 56:36.258
Oh, don't worry, honey.

56:36.342 --> 56:39.762
I'm sure we'll find Woody and Buzz
before we leave tomorrow.

56:48.188 --> 56:49.354
I need air!

56:50.023 --> 56:51.523
Will you quit movin' around?

56:51.608 --> 56:55.235
I'm sorry. It's just that I get...
I get so nervous before I travel.

56:55.320 --> 56:57.738
How did I get stuck
with you as a moving buddy?

56:57.822 --> 56:59.990
Everyone else was picked.
